OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1787051905
OL,3,CMaternity unit closure 'an absolute
OL,4,Cdisgrace', says Devon County Council
OL,5,Cleader
OL,7,FThe decision to suspend birthing
OL,8,Fservices at North Devon District
OL,9,Fhospital has been described as "an
OL,10,Fabsolute disgrace" by the leader of
OL,11,FDevon County Council.
OL,13,FCouncil leader Julian Brazil made the
OL,14,Fcomment after councillors raised
OL,15,Fconcerns about the safety of mothers-
OL,16,Fto-be having to travel to Exeter for
OL,17,Fbirths.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1787051905
OL,3,CMaternity unit closure 'an absolute
OL,4,Cdisgrace', says Devon County Council
OL,5,Cleader
OL,7,FHe was speaking at a special meeting
OL,8,Fof the scrutiny committee which was
OL,9,Fbeing held as a result of the
OL,10,Fsuspension of services.
OL,12,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,13,FNHS Foundation Trust suspended births
OL,14,Fat North Devon District Hospital in
OL,15,FBarnstaple from 11 August.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1787051905
OL,3,CMaternity unit closure 'an absolute
OL,4,Cdisgrace', says Devon County Council
OL,5,Cleader
OL,7,FCouncillors heard from senior
OL,8,Fmanagement of the Health Trust for
OL,9,FExeter and North Devon who explained
OL,10,Fthe decision was taken after a
OL,11,Fconsultant left after a family
OL,12,Fbereavement, and a locum doctor also
OL,13,Fleft.
OL,15,FThe trust decided the remaining team
OL,16,Fof six was no longer a safe level to
OL,17,Foperate an effective roster.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1787051905
OL,3,CMaternity unit closure 'an absolute
OL,4,Cdisgrace', says Devon County Council
OL,5,Cleader
OL,7,FSome councillors at the meeting were
OL,8,Falarmed to hear that the service was
OL,9,Fso "fragile", given it had taken the
OL,10,Floss of two positions to create this
OL,11,Fsituation.
OL,13,FThere were hopes that the closure of
OL,14,Fthe unit - initially announced on July
OL,15,F27th - might have been averted but
OL,16,Fdespite 'tireless efforts' the
OL,17,Fdecision was made to suspend services
OL,18,Ftemporarily.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1787051905
OL,3,CMaternity unit closure 'an absolute
OL,4,Cdisgrace', says Devon County Council
OL,5,Cleader
OL,7,FPeter Collins from the NHS Devon
OL,8,FIntegrated Care Board said, "there was
OL,9,Fa high level of concern and impact as
OL,10,Fa result of the decision".
OL,12,FSenior managers of the NHS Trust
OL,13,Fexplained that recruitment had proved
OL,14,Fchallenging over the past few years,
OL,15,Fdue to the hospital's size and
OL,16,Flocation - being one of the most
OL,17,Fremote in the country.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1787051905
OL,3,CMaternity unit closure 'an absolute
OL,4,Cdisgrace', says Devon County Council
OL,5,Cleader
OL,7,FBut Councillor Ed Tyldesley pointed
OL,8,Fout that West Cumberland in Cumbria
OL,9,Fwas a similar size hospital and was
OL,10,Fable to rotate staff more successfully
OL,11,Fwith a neighbouring hospital in
OL,12,FCarlisle.
OL,14,FThe NHS Trust says "it is actively
OL,15,Frecruiting to fill the vacant posts in
OL,16,FNorth Devon and is awaiting visa
OL,17,Fclearances for the staff."
OL,19,FThey added, that they hope to be in
OL,20,Fposition with the appropriate training
OL,21,Fby the end of September.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
